
@startuml
title Observer — Sequence : setState('Shipped') + exceptions caught

actor Client
Client -> OrderSubject : setState("Shipped")
OrderSubject -> OrderSubject : notifyObservers()

loop for each observer
  OrderSubject -> EmailObserver : update(subject)
  EmailObserver --> OrderSubject : ok

  OrderSubject -> SMSObserver : update(subject)
  note over SMSObserver
    Throw exception (e.g.: SMS service unavailable)
  end note
  SMSObserver --> OrderSubject : Exception
  note over OrderSubject
    try/catch by observer : log, metrics
    continue other notifications
  end note

  OrderSubject -> WebhookObserver : update(subject)
  WebhookObserver --> OrderSubject : ok
end

OrderSubject --> Client : Notifications finished (aggregated success/failure)
@enduml